<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Glory divine was put away</l><l>Under the tent of flesh to stay,</l><l>No outward beauty to display;</l><l>Lord, I remember Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou art a root from out dry ground,</l><l>Thou wast the Man of sorrows found,</l><l>Hated, despised by man around;</l><l>Lord, I remember Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Gentle and lowly is Thy heart,</l><l>Willing to suffer all Thou art,</l><l>To God and man complaining not;</l><l>Lord, I remember Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thou as a man art tender, sweet,</l><l>Balanced in every way, complete,</l><l>Meal-offering to the Father meet;</l><l>Lord, I remember Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Doing the Father’s will Thy prize,</l><l>Never accepting Satan’s lies,</l><l>None like Thyself, so faithful, wise;</l><l>Lord, I remember Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>For Thine obedience to God’s will,</l><l>Willing to suffer deathly ill,</l><l>E’en on the Cross my place to fill,</l><l>Lord, I remember Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Therefore hath God exalted Thee,</l><l>Given Thee glory, majesty,</l><l>Heaven and earth will bow the knee;</l><l>O Lord, I worship Thee!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
